  "job_A3.26_20261117_173743": {
    "text": "Ongunnon him on uhtan \u00e6\u00feelcunde m\u00e6g\u00f0 gierwan to geonge; wiston gumena gemot \u00e6\u00feelinges lic\nWoldan werigu wif wope bim\u00e6nan \u00e6\u00feelinges dea\u00f0 ane hwile, reonge bereotan.\nR\u00e6st w\u00e6s acolad, heard w\u00e6s hinsi\u00f0; h\u00e6le\u00f0 w\u00e6ron modge, \u00fee hy \u00e6t \u00feam beorge bli\u00f0e fundon.\nCwom seo murnende Maria on d\u00e6gred, heht hy o\u00fere mid eorles dohtor.\nSohton sarigu tu sigebearn godes \u00e6nne in \u00fe\u00e6t eor\u00f0\u00e6rn \u00fe\u00e6r hi \u00e6r wiston \u00fe\u00e6t hine gehyddan h\u00e6le\u00f0\nHuru \u00fe\u00e6s o\u00feer \u00feing wiston \u00fea wifmenn, \u00fea hy on weg cyrdon.\nAc \u00fe\u00e6r cwom on uhtan an engla \u00fereat, beh\u00e6fde heapa wyn h\u00e6lendes burg.\nOpen w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t eor\u00f0\u00e6rn, \u00e6\u00feelinges lic onfeng feores g\u00e6st, folde beofode, hlogan helwaran; hagosteald\nS\u00e6gde Iohannis, h\u00e6le\u00f0 helwarum, hlyhhende spr\u00e6c modig to \u00fe\u00e6re mengo ymb his m\u00e6ges: H\u00e6fde me\nNu sceacen.\nWene ic ful swi\u00fee ond witod to d\u00e6ge dryhten wille gesecan, sigebearn godes.\nFysde hine \u00fea to fore frea moncynnes; wolde heofona helm helle weallas forbrecan ond forbygan, \u00fe\u00e6re\nNe rohte he to \u00fe\u00e6re hilde helmberendra, ne he byrnwigend to \u00feam burggeatum l\u00e6dan ne wolde, ac \u00fea\nWr\u00e6ccan \u00ferungon, hwylc hyra \u00fe\u00e6t sygebearn geseon moste, Adam ond Abraham, Isac ond Iacob,\nGeseah \u00fea Iohannis sigebearn godes mid \u00fey cyne\u00ferymme cuman to helle, ongeat \u00fea geomormod godes\nGeseah he helle duru h\u00e6dre scinan, \u00fea \u00fee longe \u00e6r bilocen w\u00e6ron, be\u00feeahte mid \u00feystre; se \u00feegn w\u00e6s\nAbead \u00fea bealdlice burgwarena ord modig fore \u00fe\u00e6re mengo ond to his m\u00e6ge spr\u00e6c ond \u00fea wilcuman\nSwa we ealle to \u00fee an gelyfa\u00f0, dryhten min se dyra.\nIc adreag fela si\u00fe\u00fean \u00feu end to me in si\u00feadest, \u00fea \u00feu me gesealdest sweord ond byrnan, helm ond\nEala Gabrihel, hu \u00feu eart gleaw ond scearp, milde ond gemyndig ond mon\u00few\u00e6re, wis on \u00feinum gewitte\n\u00de\u00e6t \u00feu gecy\u00f0dest \u00fea \u00feu \u00feone cnyht to us brohtest in Bethlem.\nBidan we \u00fe\u00e6s longe, setan on sorgum, sibbe oflyste, wynnum ond wenum, hwonne we word godes\nEala Maria, hu \u00feu us modigne cyning acendest, \u00fea \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6t cild to us brohtest in Bethlem.\nWe \u00fe\u00e6s beofiende under helle dorum hearde sceoldon bidan in bendum.\nBona weorces gefeah; w\u00e6ron ure ealdfind ealle on wynnum \u00feonne hy gehyrdon hu we hreowen on\nNu us mon modge \u00fee ageaf from usse geogo\u00f0e.\nWe \u00feurh gifre mod beswican us sylfe; we \u00fea synne for\u00feon bera\u00f0 in urum breostum to bonan honda,\nEala Hierusalem in Iudeum, hu \u00feu in \u00fe\u00e6re stowe stille gewunadest.\nNe mostan \u00fee geondferan foldbuende ealle lifgende, \u00fea \u00fee lof singa\u00f0.\nEala Iordane in Iudeum, hu \u00feu in \u00fe\u00e6re stowe stille gewunadest.\nNales \u00feu geondflowan foldbuende; mostan hy \u00feynes w\u00e6tres wynnum brucan.\nNu ic \u00fee halsie, h\u00e6lend user, deope in gedyrstum, \u00feu eart dryhten Crist, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu us gemiltsie, monna\n\u00deu fore monna lufan \u00feinre modor bosm sylfa gesohtes, sigedryhten god, nales fore \u00feinre \u00feearfe, \u00feeoda\n\u00deu meaht ymbfon eal folca gesetu, swylce \u00feu meaht geriman, rice dryhten, s\u00e6s sondgrotu, selast ealra\nSwylce ic \u00fee halsige, h\u00e6lend user, fore inum cildhade, cyninga selast, ond fore \u00fe\u00e6re wunde, weoruda\nOferwurpe \u00feu mid \u00fey w\u00e6tre, weoruda dryhten, bli\u00fee mode ealle burgwaran, swylce git Iohannis in\nSie \u00fe\u00e6s symle meotude \u00feonc.",
